@startuml

' scale 500 width
[*] ---> INITIAL

INITIAL ---> TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK: Mode: Off Peak
INITIAL ---> TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK: Mode: Peak

INITIAL                    --> FAULT: On any error detection
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK  --> FAULT: On an error
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK  --> FAULT: On an error
FAULT                      --> INITIAL: Reset
INITIAL --> INITIAL: Reset
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK --> INITIAL: Reset
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK --> INITIAL: Reset

INITIAL: Initial state on system start-up
FAULT: System may enter this state from\nany state on error detection

TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK  --> TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK: Mode: Off-peak
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK  --> TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK: Mode: Peak

TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK  --> TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK: Mode: Off-peak
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK  --> TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK: Mode: Peak

TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_PEAK: Timer based state machine
TRAFFIC_SEQUENCE_OFF_PEAK: Sensor driven state machine



@enduml

@startuml

' scale 500 width


[*] --> TRAIN_PRESENT

NO_TRAIN_PRESENT --> TRAIN_PRESENT : Train
TRAIN_PRESENT --> NO_TRAIN_PRESENT: No Train
NO_TRAIN_PRESENT --> FAULT: Fault
TRAIN_PRESENT --> FAULT: Fault


FAULT --> TRAIN_PRESENT: Reset
TRAIN_PRESENT --> TRAIN_PRESENT: Reset
NO_TRAIN_PRESENT --> TRAIN_PRESENT: Reset




TRAIN_PRESENT: Boom gates down
NO_TRAIN_PRESENT: Boom gates up
FAULT: Controller signals a fault

@enduml




@startuml
left to right direction
:Rail Control Centre: --> (Rail Fault)
:Rail Control Centre: --> (Rail Reset)
:Traffic Control Centre: --> (Traffic Fault)
:Traffic Control Centre: --> (Traffic Reset)
:Traffic Control Centre: --> (Peak)
:Traffic Control Centre: --> (Off-Peak)
Pedestrian --> (EW Cross)
Pedestrian --> (NS Cross)
Car --> (NS Straight/Left Turn)
Car --> (NS Right Turn)
Car --> (EW Straight/LeftTurn)
Car --> (EW Right Turn)
@enduml